Turen git-inspect is an original bounded implementation of the documented git
loose-object, packfile, pack-index, and index (DIRC) binary formats. No git or
gitoxide source code is included.

This package embeds unmodified builds of:

- flate2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) with the pure-Rust miniz_oxide backend (MIT) —
  https://github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs
- RustCrypto hashes: sha1, sha2 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) —
  https://github.com/RustCrypto/hashes
- serde, serde_json, wasm-bindgen and their transitive dependencies
  (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

All operations are read-only structural reporting over caller-supplied bytes.
No repository checkout, refs traversal, network, or filesystem access occurs.
